{"parentUuid":"55a462af-aebf-475a-bee6-95aad0cc79f2","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"aa85c1ef2059b6a89","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_014Lw9HqxkgS6gmEmJU9sRjG","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## Project Map: autom9\n\n**Directory Structure:**\n```\n/autom9/\n├── autom9-backend/        Backend API service\n├── autom9-extension/      Tableau extension frontend\n├── docker-compose.yml     Full stack orchestration\n├── .env                   Shared environment secrets\n└── docs/, design-artifacts/, _bmad/  Documentation & design\n```\n\n---\n\n### 1. Backend: `/autom9-backend`\n\n**Runtime & Entry Point:**\n- Entry: `app/main.py` (FastAPI application server)\n- Command: `uvicorn app.main:app --host 0.0.0.0 --port 8000`\n- Docker: `docker/entrypoint.sh` runs migrations then uvicorn\n\n**Dependency Management:**\n- Uses `uv` (Python package manager)\n- `pyproject.toml`: Python >=3.11; FastAPI, SQLAlchemy (async), asyncpg, Alembic, Pydantic, JOSE\n- `uv.lock`: Locked dependency versions\n- Dev dependencies: pytest, pytest-asyncio, pytest-cov\n\n**Structure:**\n```\napp/\n├── main.py               FastAPI app + middleware setup\n├── api/                  Route handlers (chat, data, integrations, admin)\n├── agent/                Agent logic\n├── core/                 Config, exceptions, utilities\n├── config/               Workflow registry, settings\n├── db/                   Database engine & sessions\n├── models/               SQLAlchemy ORM models\n├── schemas/              Pydantic request/response schemas\n├── services/             Business logic\n└── integrations/         Third-party integrations\n```\n\n---\n\n### 2. Frontend/Extension: `/autom9-extension`\n\n**Framework & Build:**\n- **Svelte 5** with **Vite** bundler\n- **TypeScript** support\n- Tableau Extensions API types included\n- `npm run dev` → Vite dev server\n- `npm run build` → Production bundle to `dist/`\n- Output: `autom9.trex` (Tableau extension manifest)\n\n---\n\n### 3. Testing\n\n**Backend Tests:**\n- Path: `/autom9-backend/tests/`\n- Config: `/autom9-backend/pytest.ini` (asyncio_mode=auto)\n- Setup: `/autom9-backend/tests/conftest.py`\n- Run: `pytest` (via uv)\n- Test modules mirror app structure (agent/, api/, config/, integrations/)\n\n---\n\n### 4. Environment & Configuration\n\n**Backend .env** (`/autom9-backend/.env.example`):\n```\nDATABASE_URL=postgresql+asyncpg://user:password@localhost:5432/autom9\nENCRYPTION_KEY=your-encryption-key-here\nBACKEND_SECRET=your-backend-secret-here\nLOG_LEVEL=INFO\nDATABASE_POOL_BASE=2\nDATABASE_POOL_OVERFLOW=10\nCORS_ORIGINS=http://localhost:5173\n```\n\n**Extension .env**: Minimal (mostly default values)\n\n---\n\n### 5. Docker & Stack\n\n**docker-compose.yml** orchestrates:\n- **db**: PostgreSQL 16-alpine (port 5432)\n- **app**: Backend container from `autom9-backend/Dockerfile`\n  - Depends on healthy DB\n  - Runs alembic migrations on startup\n  - Listens on port 8000\n  - Injects env vars for DB, encryption, CORS, logging\n\n**Run locally:** `docker-compose up` (requires .env with ENCRYPTION_KEY and BACKEND_SECRET)"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":7,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1278,"cache_read_input_tokens":21040,"output_tokens":864,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1278},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":7,"output_tokens":864,"cache_read_input_tokens":21040,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1278,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1278,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"}},"requestId":"req_011CaYDa17QNp6eKdd4dPDAw","type":"assistant","uuid":"65609f0c-16e5-4f09-b0d5-1242bc262eaa","timestamp":"2026-04-29T14:26:30.582Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/praveensam/Documents/work/autom9/